# Guvenlik basliklari (statik varlik yanitlari).
#
# Workers statik varliklari, varsayilan yonlendirmede Worker betiginden ONCE
# sunulur; bu yuzden Worker'in ekledigi basliklar HTML/varlik yanitlarina
# ULASMAZ. Bu dosya ayni basliklari statik yanitlara uygular.
#
# Degerler functions/src/http/security.ts ile AYNI olmalidir. Birini
# degistirirsen digerini de guncelle (bkz. docs/guvenlik-basliklari.md).

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
